course: dictionary
lesson: 12125
title: Cometary: all about comets
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Cometary is a describing word, an adjective. It means to do with comets. A comet is an icy body that travels around the Sun and grows a glowing tail when it comes near it.
explain: Context clues help you here. «The telescope spotted cometary dust drifting near Earth.» The dust is floating around in space, and the sentence is about a telescope and space, so cometary must link the dust to comets.
explain: Space writers use cometary with other space words. «The cometary orbit is a long, stretched loop around the Sun.» An orbit is a path, so a cometary orbit is the path a comet follows, not a planet's path.
explain: Ask yourself: what is this about? When you see cometary, think comet. Then try your meaning in the sentence to check that it makes sense.
fact: Cometary means to do with comets.
fact: A comet is an icy body that travels around the Sun.
fact: «Cometary dust» means dust that comes from a comet.
fact: «Cometary orbit» means the path a comet follows around the Sun.
fact: Meteor showers can happen when the Earth passes through cometary dust.
exercise: «The scientists studied the cometary dust under a microscope.» What does cometary mean here? | To do with the sea | *To do with comets | To do with the Moon's craters | Dust that is green
exercise: «The cometary orbit takes the comet far out past Neptune and back.» What does cometary orbit mean? | *The path a comet follows around the Sun | A dark cloud of rain | A ring of rocks in the ocean | The shape of a rocket
exercise: Find the word that means to do with comets: «The cometary tail glowed as it neared the Sun.» | glowed | Sun | tail | *cometary
test: What is a comet? | A hot planet with rings | A cloud of rain on Earth | *An icy body that travels around the Sun | A rock that never moves
test: «Meteor showers can happen when the Earth passes through cometary dust.» What does cometary dust come from? | The ocean floor | A volcano | The Moon | *A comet
exam: «The cometary tail shone brightly in the night sky.» Cometary means: | A city in the sky | Very cold weather | *To do with comets | To do with the sea
